  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced. Halve cherry tomatoes. Cut red onion into thick wedges.\n• Place prepped veggies on a lined oven tray (divide between two trays if your tray is crowded). Drizzle with olive oil, season with salt and pepper and toss to coat. Roast until just tender, 10-15 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6279fe4e7e837f017206bcdf/step-489e6cfe.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• When the veggies have 5 minutes remaining, finely chop garlic.\n• In a medium frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook garlic until fragrant, 1 minute. Add light cooking cream and cook, stirring, until slightly thickened, 2-3 minutes. Season, then set aside.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6279fe4e7e837f017206bcdf/step-c5150920.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Spread pizza bases evenly with white sauce. Top with roasted veggies. Sprinkle over grated Parmesan cheese and shredded Cheddar cheese.\n• Place pizzas directly on a wire rack in the oven. Bake until cheese is melted and golden, 10-12 minutes (use two wire racks if your pizzas don't fit). TIP: Placing the pizzas directly onto the wire racks helps the bases crisp up!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6279fe4e7e837f017206bcdf/step-432c8d5d.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While the pizzas are baking, thinly slice pear. Roughly chop cucumber. In a medium bowl, combine the honey and a drizzle of balsamic vinegar and olive oil. Season, then add pear, cucumber and rocket leaves. Toss to coat.\n• Dollop basil pesto over pizza. Slice, then divide between plates.\n• Serve with pear-rocket salad. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6279fe4e7e837f017206bcdf/step-9f009894.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
